		</div>
	</dialog>

	<dialog id="cloudDialog" class="dialog">
		<form method="dialog" id="cloudForm" autocomplete="off">
			<h3>Cloud storage</h3>
			<p class="hint">Save a place in the cloud to keep a vault's encrypted data. Only ciphertext ever leaves this computer; your keys stay here. Secrets you enter are encrypted on this machine before they are saved.</p>
			<div id="cloudList"></div>
			<hr class="hr-soft">
			<p class="hint">Sign in to an account:</p>
			<div class="row-end-wrap">
				<label class="field field-grow"><span>Account</span>
