			<p class="hint">Create a link that opens this one item in someone's browser. Only encrypted data is stored — the key that unlocks it rides in the link itself and never reaches the server, so no one but the person you send the link to can read it. The link works while this app is running and reachable (on this computer, or over your network if you have exposed it).</p>
			<div id="sendStart">
